{
    "chapter_num": 13,
    "verses_count": 13,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Greatest Gift"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Though I speak with the tongues of men and of angels, but have not love, I have become sounding brass or a clanging cymbal. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And though I have "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the gift of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " prophecy, and understand all mysteries and all knowledge, and though I have all faith, so that I could remove mountains, but have not love, I am nothing. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And though I bestow all my goods to feed "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the poor,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and though I give my body "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU so I may boast"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to be burned, but have not love, it profits me nothing."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Love suffers long "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " is kind; love does not envy; love does not parade itself, is not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "arrogant"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "puffed up; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "does not behave rudely, does not seek its own, is not provoked, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "keeps no accounts of evil"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "thinks no evil; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "does not rejoice in iniquity, but rejoices in the truth; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "bears all things, believes all things, hopes all things, endures all things."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Love never fails. But whether "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " prophecies, they will fail; whether "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " tongues, they will cease; whether "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " knowledge, it will vanish away. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For we know in part and we prophesy in part. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But when that which is "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "complete"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "perfect has come, then that which is in part will be done away."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When I was a child, I spoke as a child, I understood as a child, I thought as a child; but when I became a man, I put away childish things. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For now we see in a mirror, dimly, but then face to face. Now I know in part, but then I shall know just as I also am known."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And now abide faith, hope, love, these three; but the greatest of these "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " love."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}